  "title": "Black Diamond Spot 400 Dual Fuel Headlamp",
  "handle": "black-diamond-spot-400-dual-fuel-headlamp",
  "description": "<p>Whether you're tackling pre-dawn ascents or navigating trails after dark, the Black Diamond Spot 400 Dual Fuel Headlamp delivers reliable illumination in a lightweight, waterproof design. </p>\n<p>Its 400 lumen output, coupled with PowerTap instant dimming and Brightness Memory, ensures effortless control over lighting levels. The headlamp is powered by either a BD 1500 rechargeable battery or AAA batteries, offering maximum flexibility for long expeditions. </p>\n<p>With red night vision, proximity and distance modes, and a durable low-profile build, the Spot 400 is engineered for climbers, hikers, and outdoor enthusiasts who demand performance in all conditions.</p>\n<p>Light Values:</p>\n<p><strong>Power Mode</strong><br>Light output: 400 lm<br>Light distance: 100 m<br>Run time: 2.5/4 hours</p>\n<p><strong>Medium Mode</strong><br>Light output: 200 lm<br>Light distance: 60 m<br>Run time: 5/8 hours</p>\n<p><strong>Low Power Mode</strong><br>Light output: 6 lm<br>Light distance: 12 m<br>Run time: 200/225 hours</p>",
